WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.954
The math.

00:00:00.954 --> 00:00:03.897
A MAID procedure costs twenty-five hundred dollars.

00:00:03.897 --> 00:00:06.715
A wheelchair ramp costs three to eight thousand.

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:10.681
Annual disability benefits cost fifteen to forty thousand per veteran.

00:00:10.681 --> 00:00:14.181
It is cheaper to kill a veteran than to provide a ramp for two years.
